FIFO Interface
CONFIG_GRFIFO_ENABLE
  Say Y here to enable the external FIFO interface controller.

FIFO Data Width
CONFIG_GRFIFO_WIDTH
  Sets the width of the external FIFO data interface. Only 16-bit width is currently supported.

FIFO Address Width
CONFIG_GRFIFO_ABITS
  Set the width of the data pointers used for the circular buffers placed in memory.
  Valid values are from 16 to 16, inclusive.

FIFO Interrupt
CONFIG_GRFIFO_IRQ
  Set the interrupt number for the first FIFO interrupt. Remaining six interrupts will
  have incrementing interrupts when multiple interrupts are used. A zero value disables all interrupts.

Single FIFO Interrupt
CONFIG_GRFIFO_SINGLE
  Enable the usage of a single FIFO interrupt, else seven separate interrupts will be used.
